NOTE ON THE CORPUS. This licence covers the source code in this repository.
It does NOT cover the regulatory texts the system indexes. Those are ingested
at build time from their publishers under their own terms (see ADR-0002 and
`src/grc_rag/ingest.py` for the enforced allowlist): NIST AI RMF and the NIST
Generative AI Profile are US Government works; the EU AI Act text is reproduced
from EUR-Lex. ISO/IEC 42001 is copyrighted and paywalled and is deliberately
never ingested — only its clause identifiers are referenced.
